<title>POLAND: ANIMEX 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 14.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>ANIMEX 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 14.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.74 vs  31.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.62 vs  24.51</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.99 vs   5.25 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   38.69 vs  25.70</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    14.74 vs  41.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	21.75 vs  36.98</p>
<p> Operating profit    17.73 vs  15.94</p>
<p> Sales		  476.35 vs 531.46</p>
<p>Note. Sales and profits for the January-December 1995 period</p>
<p>included results of five divisions which in December 1995 were</p>
<p>hived off as Animex subsidiaries and since then have not been</p>
<p>included in the company's parent results.</p>
<p>Full name of the Polish food trader and producer is Animex SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
